-->     whats a host?

A host is a device connected to the network that can communicate using the network!


                        wifi router
            laptop          tv          phone

laptop, tv and phone are all considered hosts because the three are connected to the network!

anything that participate in a netwrok can be called a host!

- a webserver can be called a host
- cloud can be called a host
- virtual machine can be called a host
- your computer running linux can be called a host!

